                                "sense_id": "eb70468d-1b67-3600-8fc0-f90597ce30f7",
                                "text": "Of the colour of the mahogany bank furniture was Uncle Bushrod--thus dark was he externally; white as the uninked pages of the bank ledgers was his soul."
